  ('cs_eric-trump_career', 'ent_eric-trump', 'career', 'Career', 'Eric Frederick Trump (born January 6, 1984) is an American businessman, political activist, and former reality television presenter. He is the third child and second son of U.S. president Donald Trump and his first wife, Ivana.
Trump is a trustee and executive vice president of his father''s business, The Trump Organization, running it alongside his older brother Donald Jr. He was a boardroom judge on his father''s television series The Apprentice. 
